{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14231350","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14231350","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1423135001:1":{"text":"저 제사장들은 저를 노리고 온 겁니다... 놀라게 해 드려서 죄송합니다.","source_cn":"这些祭司应该是冲我来的……抱歉，让各位受惊了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4544B70188B4FED7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423135002:0":{"text":"놀란 건 아니야. 우리 드워프들도 세상 물정은 좀 안다고. 그래서, 저 제사장들이 왜 공격한 건데?","source_cn":"受惊倒是没有，我们矮人也是见过世面的。她们为什么要袭击你？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x728AAB261DD8F43A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423135003:1":{"text":"한때 플린과 몰래 손을 잡았던 제사장인 대제사장 퀸의 휘하에 있던 이들입니다.","source_cn":"这些祭司之前都是奎茵大祭司的手下，也就是与弗林达成秘密...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B124FDD96D24AF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423135004:1":{"text":"퀸이 몰락하고 강력한 마력을 지녔던 제사장들이 갈 곳을 잃어서... 원망을 품고 반란을 꾀했지요.","source_cn":"奎茵落败后，祭司们身负精深的魔力，却无容身之处……有些...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x290A7FBA2F956266","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423135005:1":{"text":"셀로클랜드의 평민들 대부분도 마법을 사용할 수 있습니다. 그런데 지금 수많은 평민들이 일자리를 잃어서...","source_cn":"萨洛克兰大多数的平民都能使用魔法，现在大量的平民失业……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDA13D016F436561","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423135006:1":{"text":"반란보다 심각한 것은 평민들이 삶의 터전을 잃었다는 것입니다.","source_cn":"相比叛乱，更严重的是平民的生活没有着落。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D782329B91C9A51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423135007:1":{"text":"그래서 이번 협력을 추진하고 싶습니다.","source_cn":"这也是我想推进合作的原因。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A97C50ABAABDAD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1423135008:1":{"text":"간단하게 말해서 드워프의 돈이나 좀 벌어보겠다 이거네.","source_cn":"简单点说，就是想从矮人这赚钱了呗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1F4884BD14F746F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1423135009:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1423135010:1":{"text":"아이언비어드, 안 해도 되는 말은 좀 그만 해요!","source_cn":"铁须，不该说的你能不能少说点！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F28C4C5CCC1F899","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_stat